(47, 'Joomla!Day Bangkok 2009', 'joomladay-bangkok-2009', '', '<img src=\"images/stories/demo/joomladay_bangkok2009.jpg\" alt=\"Joomladay bangkok 2009\" align=\"right\" title=\"Joomladay bangkok 2009\" class=\"caption\" />\r\n\r\n<p>The Thai Joomla! Community is looking forward to their third Joomla! Day Bangkok in Thailand\'s beautiful and thriving capital city. The event will be held on Saturday, August 22th and Sunday,August 23th 2009, from 9:00 AM until 5:00 PM at Sripatum University.The place where the event has a conference room for 800+ people.&nbsp; JoomlaCorner.com and the National Electronics and Computer Technology Center (NECTEC) invite you to attend Joomla! Day Bangkok 2009 which promises to be an incredible day of learning, sharing, and networking with others.</p>\r\n\r\n', '\r\n\r\n<h3>This year, several key members of the Joomla! community are scheduled to speak:</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<li>Mr. Samuel Moffatt - Joomla! Core Team and Developer Working Group</li>\r\n<li>Mr. Toby Patterson - Joomla! Development Working Group</li>\r\n<li>Mr. Akarawuth Tamrareang - Joomla! Bug Squad, core developer for VirtueMart, and JoomlaCorner.com.</li>\r\n<li>Mr. Pisan Chuechatchai - Joomla! Translation Working Group</li>\r\n<li>Mr. Supachai Teasakul&nbsp; - Joomla! Translation Working Group</li>\r\n<li>Mr.Azrul Rahim - Azrul.com</li>\r\n<li>Mr. Dinh Viet Hung&nbsp; - <a href=\"http://www.joomlart.com\" title=\"JoomlArt\" target=\"_blank\">JoomlArt.com</a></li>\r\n<li>Mr.Apisilp Trunganont - MacroArt.net</li>\r\n<li>Mr.Twin Panichsombat&nbsp; - Total Access Communication (DTAC)</li>\r\n<li>Mr.Nattachai Ungsriwong - Crie.co.th</li>\r\n<li>Mr.Sanguan Thammarojsakul - Microsoft (Thailand) Limited.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>The agenda for Joomla! Day Bangkok 2009 includes a wide variety of interesting topics. Whether you are a professional Web site editor, publisher, developer, or administrator, or if you are simply interested in learning more about Joomla!, there will something for you.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>All over the world, local communities gather at Joomla! Day events. Joomla! Days are a great way for people who are interested in Joomla! to get together, learn from one another, find ways to contribute to the Joomla! community, and have fun. We wish for our community members in Thailand an enjoyable and successful Joomla! Day Bangkok 2009 again.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For more information: visit <a title=\"JoomlaDay.in.th Website\" href=\"http://www.joomladay.in.th\">http://joomladay.in.th</a> and <a title=\"Registeration to join JoomlaDay Bangkok 2009\" href=\"http://joomladay.in.th/en/registration.html\">register online</a>.</p>', 1, 4, 0, 30, '2009-10-14 09:11:33', 62, '', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '2009-10-14 09:11:33', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'show_title=\nlink_titles=\nshow_intro=\nshow_section=\nlink_section=\nshow_category=\nlink_category=\nshow_vote=\nshow_author=\nshow_create_date=\nshow_modify_date=\nshow_pdf_icon=\nshow_print_icon=\nshow_email_icon=\nlanguage=\nkeyref=\nreadmore=', 1, 0, 3, '', '', 0, 23, 'robots=\nauthor='),
(48, 'Joomla Day Brazil 2009', 'joomla-day-brazil-2009', '', '<img src=\"images/stories/demo/joomladaybrazil2009.gif\" alt=\"Joomla Day Brazil 2009\" align=\"right\" title=\"Joomla Day Brazil 2009\" class=\"caption\" />\r\n\r\n<p>After a very tough dispute between the two largest cities in Brazil - Sao Paulo and Rio de Janeiro, the Wonderful City, as Rio is also known, was chosen as headquarters for the Joomla! Day Brazil 2009. The place where the event will be carried through, at the feet of the Sugar Loaf mountain, has a conference room for 300 people and an ample space for coffee-break and networking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Important developers, companies and members of the Joomla Project! have already confirmed their presence. We have planned a full day with lectures for beginning users and developers, case studies and a lot of networking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We feel this last one is the most valuable, because our wish is for the Community to grow as a whole and for everyone to walk side-by-side towards a better CMS and a better Internet.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We have a limited availability for attendance to this event and we are offering a discount for those who sign up until July 25. So Hurry up if you are serious about learning more about Joomla! and meeting prominent members of the community.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>More info at <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://www.joomladaybrasil.org/2009/\">http://www.joomladaybrasil.org/2009/</a> (Portuguese only, sorry!)<br />\r\nFollow us on Twitter: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://twitter.com/joomladaybr2009\">http://twitter.com/joomladaybr2009</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Join us in September 12 at the ECEM - Escola de Estado Maior do Ex', '', 1, 4, 0, 30, '2009-10-14 09:25:43', 62, '', '2009-10-14 09:27:49', 62, 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '2009-10-14 09:25:43', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'show_title=\nlink_titles=\nshow_intro=\nshow_section=\nlink_section=\nshow_category=\nlink_category=\nshow_vote=\nshow_author=\nshow_create_date=\nshow_modify_date=\nshow_pdf_icon=\nshow_print_icon=\nshow_email_icon=\nlanguage=\nkeyref=\nreadmore=', 2, 0, 2, '', '', 0, 5, 'robots=\nauthor='),
(49, 'Joomla!Day Hungary 2009', 'joomladay-hungary-2009', '', '<img src=\"images/stories/demo/jday-hungary-2009.jpg\" alt=\"Joomla!Day Hungary 2009\" align=\"right\" title=\"Joomla!Day Hungary 2009\" class=\"caption\" />\r\n\r\n<p>It\'s already a tradition, that on the second Saturday of October the Hungarian Joomla! users come together on their Joomla!Day, or Joomla!Nap in Hungarian. This year it will take place on October 10, from 10.00 am CET to 5.00 pm CET in Hungary, organized by <a href=\"http://www.joomla.org.hu/\" mce_href=\"http://www.joomla.org.hu/\">Joomla! User Association Hungary</a> (JUAH). The last year venue worked well, so we decided to return to <a href=\"http://www.ceucenter.hu/\" mce_href=\"http://www.ceucenter.hu/\">CEU Conference Center, Budapest</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n', '\r\n\r\n<p>Among others, <a href=\"http://webdesigner.blog.hu/\" mce_href=\"http://webdesigner.blog.hu/\">Zsuzsanna T', 1, 4, 0, 30, '2009-10-14 09:29:18', 62, '', '2009-10-14 09:33:38', 62, 0, '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '2009-10-14 09:29:18', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', '', '', 'show_title=\nlink_titles=\nshow_intro=\nshow_section=\nlink_section=\nshow_category=\nlink_category=\nshow_vote=\nshow_author=\nshow_create_date=\nshow_modify_date=\nshow_pdf_icon=\nshow_print_icon=\nshow_email_icon=\nlanguage=\nkeyref=\nreadmore=', 3, 0, 1, '', '', 0, 4, 'robots=\nauthor='),
